-- 1. All Clear — the failure is over. The abutment stands alone; dust settles.
-- Eval 00-setup.tidal first.
-- ~28 cycles (~75 s at 90 BPM).

glideBpm 90 16
-- clear the previous piece's working orbits
fadeSilence 8 [1,2,3,7,8,9]

-- the surviving mass: a low D pedal and a sus2 piano
d4 pianoPedal
d6 $ bassPedal # amp 0.2
-- the room breathes
d10 air
-- one high shadow, far away
xfadeIn 5 24 $ pianoColour (slow 4 hClear |+ 12) # amp 0.4 # lpf 2600
